our conversation doesn't appear to pertain to the issue ("any" does not occ=
ur, for example).=A0 In the simplest terms -- to get back to the main point=
 (I thought), the difference you want is between the {[su'o] da poi=A0 cidj=
a} inside (indefinite) or outside (definite but one stated) the {lo nu terv=
e'u da}.=A0=20
